  "description": "Simple but flexible and powerful utility for generating random names: \n- human-like, e.g. Jim Deam, Henrie Avdeev, Lanita Leutbecher\n- or github/docker style identifiers, like sympathetic_alligator, UnsuitedHistorian, Psychedelic-FundRaiser\n- or anything in between, like\nBob_The_Builder, Well-dressed-Entertainer, Medium-rare SeaTurtle Eldon, RoannaTheJoblessComputer etc\n\nAll with configurable number of components, separators, length and structure, usable in a single line of code.\n\nOver 100000 unique words in various categories allow hundreds of milions of combinations!",
  "id": "RandomFriendlyNameGenerator",
